id: pm-rl-meta
title: Improve bounded training recipes over public tracker histories
description: "Content-addressed bounded recipes, deterministic outer search, isolated repository splits and durable shared-budget inner loops with honest final-test reporting."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-18T03:01:18.320Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T14:16:11.994Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Two bounded real-data meta-generations; seeded and optional decision-model proposals; recipe lineage, fail-closed promotion, no held-out leakage, idempotent reservation and resume; regression revert proofs and unchanged npm/Bun release gates."
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[50]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T03:07:08.225Z",codex-agent,"Design: recipes bind declared learning-rate, inner generation/step, batch, data-selection, curriculum, temperature and reward-weight domains. The outer controller reuses existing leases and digested phase receipts; every inner fit uses the packaged process trainer and the same approved atomic resource reservations. Separate repository roles supply training, meta-validation and untouched final-test data; training-repository items are further split for inner held-out evaluation. Only sanitized lifecycle-state prefixes leave committed public MIT histories. Statistical recipe selection uses exact-match meta-validation evidence with distinct-example counts and a comparison-wise confidence allocation; proxy rewards cannot authorize recipe promotion. Conservative search reservations are held once across resume. No release enablement or dependency pin change."
  "2026-10-18T03:24:16.558Z",codex-agent,"Initial numerical and public-dataset regressions passed 8/8. Real-data acceptance caught and corrected the installed GitHub CLI license metadata contract (MIT is licenseInfo.key=mit); public visibility and public commit checks remain mandatory. The optional proposer now persists a pre-request intent: completed results replay; an unresolved response falls back to the seeded recipes without making another physical request. The search domain is deliberately small (at most two inner steps and 256 samples per batch), and reservations derive their worst-case charge from the declared recipe domains. Shared-host deadline failures are retained; no existing acceptance timeout or coverage threshold was relaxed."
  "2026-10-18T03:31:31.203Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof in an isolated source snapshot: remove only the recipe field from generationTrainingConfig, retain all tests, and run node --test test/recipe.test.ts. Result: 2/3 pass, the lineage regression fails because its stored recipe digest is undefined; restored function passes 3/3. Separately remove only the public-visibility conjunct from the dataset source guard and run node --test --test-name-pattern=\"builder fails before\" test/dataset.test.ts: 0/1 pass, Missing expected exception for PRIVATE metadata. The restored package retains the guard. No thresholds, legacy code paths or dependency pins changed. Both tests import TypeScript sources directly, so no dist rebuild is needed for these proofs."
  "2026-10-18T03:43:18.600Z",codex-agent,"Live acceptance PASS: npm run test:live completed two meta-generations, K=2, over 25 public MIT repositories (15 train, 5 meta-validation, 5 final-test); one verified empty source omitted. Dataset a4320672ba0d2f20e1aebfba7b9e91de71c95e17a9706700f79dfe163c8aae0c contains 1023 train, 145 inner held-out, 214 meta-validation, 385 final-test examples (1767 total). Initial recipe b77fdfeff48dc713d46b397ff6ea652257fe46ca09650264ba5563e4e53a34ae: learning_rate=0.25, steps=2, batch=128, temperature=1, reward weights=1/0, selection=all, curriculum=forward. Generation 1 candidates 800886e9f4cd and 45113586500f; generation 2 candidates 4a48567235f1 and 55539a90ca05. Every resulting policy scored 107/214=0.5 on meta-validation: gain 0, lower confidence gain bound -0.21778781183411927, refusal no_statistical_improvement. Confidence 0.95 allocated across four comparisons gives 0.9875 each; effect threshold 0.01 and minimum samples 10 unchanged. No recipe promoted: inner promotion retained seed policies. Final untouched test before/after 198/385=0.5142857142857142. Dataset build plus controller 574489.248227 ms; parent watchdog unchanged at 15 minutes. Complete public source commits, recipes and verdicts: docs/meta-live-evidence.json. No improvement claim."
  "2026-10-18T03:47:10.210Z",codex-agent,"Further real-controller regressions PASS 3/3: a physical outer-controller SIGKILL adopts the committed initial fit and original settled reservation; a high-signal synthetic fixture promotes a statistically better recipe and uses it as the next meta-generation incumbent; one shared Decision refuses expanded/replaced/oversubscribed budgets, including differently formatted reservation bodies. The full tracker read path remains certified. Normal local health exposes a global pm-github host-version skew (pinned 2026.10.13 versus global 2026.10.17); the isolated CI HOME/Git configuration passes strict health with only pre-existing advisory provenance debt (pm-rl-9uz4). No pin bump, telemetry configuration change or history repair performed. Linked pm test selection 1 passes 8/8; result tracking is disabled by existing project policy, so this comment retains the receipt."
  "2026-10-18T03:55:07.043Z",codex-agent,"The search now receives sealed evaluator capabilities (fit, selection scores, final-test scores and dataset digest) rather than dataset readers. Dataset coordinates and all example loading stay in tracker-environment.ts; the proposer receives a fresh recipe-only request object. Terminal replay still succeeds with inner and final files unavailable, and the final-test callback runs after all promotion receipts. Unknown recipe knobs are rejected against the declared domain keys. The CLI optional seed/proposer defaults and camel-cased tracker option are fixed; direct real-tracker CLI and synthetic live-entry regressions pass 2/2. The physical-kill/promotion/shared-budget trio also passes 3/3 through the linked PM harness; result recording remains disabled by policy."
  "2026-10-18T03:58:51.495Z",codex-agent,"Final real-data acceptance after evaluator capability isolation passes again: the complete dataset manifest and policy/gate/final-test report are byte-equivalent as JSON to the first successful run (same 25 eligible public repos, 1767 examples, four refused recipes, gain 0 with lower bound -0.21778781183411927, final-test 198/385 before and after). No statistical or feature tuning followed final-test exposure. The governing programme now binds the canonical approval item identity as well as its spec digest; an identical replacement Decision cannot switch budgets during resume. Full npm and Bun release gates follow with unchanged thresholds and CI identity isolation."
  "2026-10-18T04:05:27.268Z",codex-agent,"Self-review tightened the evaluator boundary before the final gates: outer accounting and proposal recovery now perform certified Decision metadata listings with bodies excluded, then open only the stable reservation namespace or exact proposal-attempt record. They no longer request every tracker body, which could include inner environment/seed datasets. Reservation discovery uses stable item identities, so a title edit cannot hide an allocation. Regression cases include unrelated prose, copied envelopes, independent approvals and replacement Decisions with identical specs. The first release-gate attempt was deliberately interrupted for this correction; no passing full-gate result is claimed from it."
  "2026-10-18T04:49:36.187Z",codex-agent,"Final ledger regressions pass 3/3: interrupted atomic reservations retain one charge, independent programmes cannot oversubscribe, and approval replacement or copied/corrupt reservation tuples are refused. Programme identity, canonical approval ID, recipe plan and exact charge vector are bound into the durable receipt. Full npm and Bun release gates now run against the frozen implementation; thresholds and legacy deadlines remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-18T05:09:33.934Z",codex-agent,"Full npm gate attempt on 1b00e1b reached an existing regression timeout: SIGKILL at every HTTP-to-PM receipt boundary replays one decision per query exceeded its unchanged 300000 ms limit (300019.19627 ms). Its merged fix and prior measured evidence remain documented under pm-rl-bi4v. The new dataset cases passed 6/6 before this failure. Retain this failed attempt, inspect the completed result, and retry without extending deadlines or changing coverage thresholds; no passing full-gate claim is made."
  "2026-10-18T05:29:44.668Z",codex-agent,"Draft PR #84 is open at 1b00e1b67c3fe7b6b396d28ecf6d8793843b3840. GitHub Node 26 CI passes 611/611, zero failures/skips, all 35 authored sources at statements/lines/branches/functions 100/100/100/100. The original eight-boundary HTTP SIGKILL drill passes there in 15884.547137 ms under its unchanged 300000 ms deadline. CodeQL passed; Node 22 remains running. Local npm remains a failed attempt because of the earlier timeout and is continuing for diagnostic coverage; local npm and Bun gates are still required. CodeRabbit explicitly skipped review of the draft, which is not approval evidence."
  "2026-10-18T05:34:31.818Z",codex-agent,"Both original CI matrix jobs passed on 1b00e1b: Node 22 and 26 each 611/611, zero failures/skips, 35 sources at 100/100/100/100 and 295 documented declarations. To execute the exact required npm and Bun release commands reproducibly, CI now retains test (22) and test (26), adds Bun release (26), and invokes the full existing release:check script with isolated HOME and global/system Git configuration. No gate, deadline, source scope, threshold, dependency pin or release approval changed. The overloaded-host npm attempt was deliberately stopped after its recorded HTTP crash-drill timeout; its cancellation output is retained and is not passing evidence. Exact-command CI receipts remain pending."
  "2026-10-18T05:36:06.534Z",codex-agent,"The strengthened CI uses separate literal npm and Bun steps selected by the fixed matrix. The static publish-attestation gate correctly refused an unresolved dynamic executable during development; the literal version passes the verifier and all 8/8 attestation tests, zero skips. YAML parsing confirms exactly three intended combinations. Required Node check names, the Bun install check and read-only workflow permissions are preserved. Exact release-command CI now runs on the branch; release approval remains disabled."
  "2026-10-18T05:59:59.550Z",codex-agent,"A real SDK boundary probe found a concrete accounting defect: UPPER became a lowercase item id while its reservation body retained UPPER. A second programme then reserved another 1024 samples under a 1024-sample approval, before either fit. The fix rejects noncanonical programme ids before any write and case-folds retained ledger identities, so earlier uppercase allocations remain charged. Focused ledger regressions pass 4/4. Isolated behavioural revert proofs retain the new test: remove only the runRlMeta id guard and it fails 0/1 with noncanonical programme reached a write; restore it and remove only reserveMeta case folding and it fails 0/1 with retained allocation was hidden; restore both and it passes 1/1. Exact command: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"programme identity cannot hide\" test/meta.test.ts. These are direct TypeScript source tests. Numerical training, data splits and statistical gates are unchanged. The previous three exact-command CI jobs passed 611/611 each on f622177, but that evidence predates this correction; full gates must rerun with 612 tests."
  "2026-10-18T06:03:14.724Z",codex-agent,"Pinned-PM linked verification on the corrected tree passes 9/9 for node --test test/recipe.test.ts test/dataset.test.ts and 1/1 for node --test --test-name-pattern=\"programme identity cannot hide\" test/meta.test.ts, zero failures/skips. The existing physical-kill, genuine-promotion and one-approval linked trio previously passed 3/3 and remains in the full suite. Test-result persistence remains disabled by project policy; comments retain the receipts. Build and test compilation, lint, duplicate detection and docstring verification pass: 35 source files, 295 documented declarations, zero clones. The documented approval-template CLI smoke also passes against a real tracker with a full Decision read."
  "2026-10-18T06:08:25.887Z",codex-agent,"Corrected-source live acceptance PASS on c882cc2527ace62cff02af25a85b5bb30dedb2a4: npm run test:live reproduced the complete real dataset manifest and report exactly. Two meta-generations, K=2, 25 public MIT repositories, 1767 examples (1023 train, 145 inner held-out, 214 meta-validation, 385 final-test). Incumbent b77fdfeff48d; candidates 800886e9f4cd, 45113586500f, 4a48567235f1 and 55539a90ca05 all score 107/214, gain 0, lower gain bound -0.21778781183411927; none promoted. Final-test before/after remains 198/385=0.5142857142857142. Dataset digest a4320672ba0d2f20e1aebfba7b9e91de71c95e17a9706700f79dfe163c8aae0c. Dataset/controller elapsed 92238.67339099999 ms within the unchanged 15-minute watchdog. Source identity is recorded in docs/meta-live-evidence.json. Recipe, bounds, seed, approvals, splits and statistical settings were not tuned after final-test exposure. Current full CI is still running with 612 tests."
  "2026-10-18T06:39:15.630Z",codex-agent,"The corrected production source c882cc2 passed the full Bun release gate 612/612, zero failures/skips, all 35 required sources at 100/100/100/100 and 295 documented declarations. The Node 22 and Node 26 jobs each failed only the existing Compose LM resource drill, respectively missing native OOM evidence and collecting a second Run. Those fault-injection assumptions are now explicit and bounded, tracked with pm-rl-whrd: native allocator and deadline barrier with unchanged limits/assertions. Both fixture-only behavioural reverts fail 0/1; restored physical and PM-linked checks pass 1/1 each. Linked feature tests now cover 9/9 data/recipe, 3/3 core crash/promotion/budget, 1/1 canonical identity and 1/1 real resource refusal. Production training, recipe bounds, splits and statistical promotion are unchanged. The complete 612-test npm/Bun CI matrix must pass on the forthcoming commit; no passing npm result is claimed for c882cc2."
  "2026-10-18T07:03:11.951Z",codex-agent,"Complete verification PASS on 445b2327b4f60a0b7f183e7c6195f7d883b41c53: CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/39104826277 executes npm run release:check on Node 22 and 26 and bun run release:check on Node 26 with isolated HOME and global/system Git configuration. Each passes 612/612, zero failures/skips/cancellations, statements/lines/branches/functions 100/100/100/100 across all 35 required sources, 295 documented declarations, zero clones and production audit findings. Publish attestation, identities, package contents, changelog and Bun graph install pass; CodeQL passes. Fresh PM-linked core run passes 3/3 on the corrected production source, alongside 9/9 data/recipe, 1/1 identity and 1/1 native resource refusal. RECURSIVE_TRAINING.md criterion 7 is Met for bounded execution and honest refusal; live source c882cc2 reproduces all real-data results exactly, with no recipe promoted or final-test gain. Six behavioural revert proofs fail with tests retained, restored implementations pass. External review provides no approval: CodeRabbit skips under its star policy, Greptile trial expired, Sourcery skipped, Cubic neutral. Recorded local HTTP timeout remains failed evidence; no deadline, threshold, dependency pin, telemetry setting or release approval changed. Leave in progress for orchestrator verification; the final receipt commit changes documentation/tracker state only and its exact-head CI will be checked before stopping."
  "2026-10-18T07:14:44.751Z",codex-agent,"Final full-branch whitespace verification found one extra blank line at the end of tracker-environment.ts. Removed only that blank line; runtime statements, knobs, data and promotion criteria are unchanged. The full diff whitespace check now passes. The prior complete code gate remains 612/612 in all three CI variants; the formatting head will receive the same exact-command matrix before stopping. Release the claim after this formatting-only handoff; leave status in progress and closure to the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-18T07:41:06.103Z",codex-agent,"Reopened implementation work for PR 84 orchestrator review: measure held-out majority baselines and aggregate prediction diversity, add a committed learnable-signal promotion sanity case at the unchanged live gate, and document a prefix-aware learner follow-up if real-data performance remains below baseline. Existing audits, CI evidence, and completed implementation are retained."
  "2026-10-18T07:46:49.973Z",codex-agent,"Review diagnosis on the retained live dataset: majority completed baseline is 211/214 on meta-validation and 384/385 on final-test, versus learner 107/214 and 198/385. All accepted weights are zero because no inner candidate passed promotion; recipes therefore share the same seed policy, rather than collapsing to a single predicted label. Prefix-aware learning is tracked in pm-rl-prefix. Committed tracker-signal fixture uses a declared known signal and the unchanged live criterion confidence 0.95, minimum 10, effect 0.01: generation 1 promotes with gain 0.0686, lower bound 0.03899585625398397; final score rises 5093/10000 to 5806/10000. No real-data threshold or feature changed."
